                "text": "\ud83d\udccd@NorthHudsonCAC in @OfficialUCNJ \n\n\ud83d\udce2 While Republicans work to cut Medicaid & make it harder for Americans to have access to affordable care, it's critical we stand up for our Federally Qualified Health Centers & protect the essential services millions rely on. \n\nI look forward to continuing to support them & the incredible work they do in @HudCoTweet and beyond.",
