                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Ever wonder why Republicans don\u2019t hold town halls? \ud83e\udd14 \n\nProbably because they don\u2019t want their constituents to know what will happen when they LET ACA tax credits expire. So we\u2019ll do it for them:\n\n32,000 people in @CongressmanKean\u2019s district will see their health care costs go up.\n\n27,000 people in @Congressman_JVD\u2019s district will see their health care costs go up.\n\n41,000 people in Chris Smith\u2019s district will see their health care costs go up.\n\nMeanwhile, @HouseDemocrats are holding the line, fighting to protect healthcare, lower costs, and build a stronger NJ - together.",
